        "summary": "Register one authorized Agent terminal delivery",
        "description": "Private Process Server route for the fixed Agent Outbox producer. Current SERVICE permissions and the registered producer, tenant, source and dispatch owner determine admission. An exact replay returns the original event ID, fingerprint and receivedAt plus the current receipt state. The sender acknowledges delivery only when both returned identifiers match. Native application happens separately.",
